+/* -------------------------------------------------------------------- */
+/** \name Tablet Input: Sticky Modifiers & Clickable Status Bar
+ *
+ * Touch and pen input without a keyboard (see the "Beyond Mouse and Keyboard" tablet plan):
+ * - Sticky modifiers ("Modifier Wheel"): Ctrl / Shift / Alt / OS held from the screen.
+ *   They are added to events when they are handled, never stored in the window event-state,
+ *   so they can't leak into (or get stuck in) the real keyboard modifier state.
+ * - Clickable status bar: while a modal operator runs, mouse input that starts over the
+ *   status bar goes to the status bar (whose key hints are buttons injecting their key)
+ *   instead of the modal operator.
+ * \{ */
